00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,119
Arrange the standard reduction potentials in order, and you get the electrochemical series.

2
00:00:06,119 --> 00:00:18,815
Lithium, potassium, calcium, sodium, magnesium, aluminium, zinc, iron, nickel, tin, lead, then hydrogen at zero, then copper, silver and gold.

